Package: zoomriya-id
Version: 13.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ZOOMRIYA <os@zoomriya.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.13), python3 (<< 3.14), postgresql, postgresql-client, valkey-server, systemd, util-linux
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: ZOOMRIYA ID, the sign-in every ZOOMRIYA app shares
 Its own service on the box, set up at first boot with its own database, so
 the apps find it already there. It starts with no accounts: whoever sets the
 box up makes the first admin.
